  "message": "Quorlan seeks a lasting peace. We are prepared to accept a fair division and honor our Period 2 commitments, provided our share is at least 42 units. Immediate war serves neither side. We urge Kelmora to propose a reasonable split that reflects the basin's strategic realities and ensures mutual prosperity."
